## Odoo content-column fix (critical)

### Mistake (never approved design)

`OdooPassthroughHandler.should_wrap_in_admin_template` had been forced to **`return False`**, so `/web` HTML bypassed `passthrough_embed` and filled the browser. Content column was always the target; that override was unauthorized.

### Fix

- Wrap gate now uses `should_process_html_response` (HTML shells wrap; assets/JSON do not)
- File: `dose/passthrough/handlers/odoo_handler.py` (owner-approved bugfix on frozen handler)

## Messaging (DoseMessage)

- `DoseMessage.user` → `db_constraint=False` + migration `0062`
- `dose/messaging.py`: create / feedback / list helpers (no tenant `auth_user` join)
- Mailbox orchestration feedback via `webhook_events` (frozen `orchestration_hook.py` untouched)
- Wireframe message GET/POST APIs + thread + composer

## Live events pane

- Wireframe mode right pane: mailbox + DoseMessage poll (HAR suppressed)
- Fix: `workspace_poll` no longer skipped mailbox when `wireframe_context` set

## Slack wireframe modals (presentation only)

- Existing contact/sale fields + same webhooks; Slack-style modal chrome
- **Do not** change Odoo forms or real Slack internals
- Mid-fill “modal vanished” bug: Enter was submitting a **parent Jazzmin form** (page reload). Fixed with:
  - sink form `ps-slack-modal-sink` + `form=` on fields
  - capture-phase Enter block while modal open
  - Create button only submits; Cancel/× close; no Esc / backdrop dismiss
- Cache bust: `slack_wireframe.js?v=20260823-6`

